\
  Why dropout helps generalisation:\
  - Forces the network to learn redundant feature representations \'97 no single neuron can\
  memorise training-specific patterns\
  - At test time, all neurons are active but the learned features are more robust\
  - Combined with morphological augmentation, the model should generalise better to\
  different stroke styles\
